set for the next owner."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.57, 0.78, 0.85, 1.16, 1.44, 1.75, 2.08, 2.18, 2.46, 2.67, 2.79, 3.17, 3.29, 3.37, 3.69]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0].why"], "text": "Did the City know? And did the rent or terms change after?", "t0": 68.47, "t1": 71.45, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "A sale under a long City lease turns the lease into an asset for the next owner."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.26, 0.51, 1.02, 1.2, 1.33, 1.43, 1.67, 1.82, 2.18, 2.52]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "suspicious[1].what"], "text": "Then 1380 Howard Street.", "t0": 71.67, "t1": 73.36, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "kicker": "File 171178", "text": "1380 Howard Street: rent $3,417,862 a year", "mark": "$3,417,862"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.62, 0.9, 1.25]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "suspicious[1].what"], "text": "The City rents it for 3,417,862 dollars a year.", "t0": 73.48, "t1": 76.39, "shot": "b7c", "visual": {"type": "doc", "kicker": "File 171178", "text": "1380 Howard Street: rent $3,417,862 a year", "mark": "$3,417,862"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.38, 0.64, 0.76, 0.87, 1.11, 1.35, 1.61, 1.86, 2.16, 2.51, 2.58]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what", "links[3]"], "text": "On the 2025-26 roll,", "t0": 76.51, "t1": 78.45, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["2025-26 roll", "$5,397,142"], "b": ["2026-27 roll", "$28,298,880"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.23, 0.49, 1.0, 1.08, 1.62]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what", "links[3]"], "text": "its value was 5,397,142 dollars.", "t0": 78.45, "t1": 81.1, "shot": "b8c", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["2025-26 roll", "$5,397,142"], "b": ["2026-27 roll", "$28,298,880"]}, "wt": [0.04, 0.25, 0.57, 0.69, 0.95, 1.23, 1.5, 1.74, 2.08]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what", "links[3]"], "text": "On the 2026-27 roll: 28,298,880.", "t0": 81.22, "t1": 85.37, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["2025-26 roll", "$5,397,142"], "b": ["2026-27 roll", "$28,298,880"]}, "emph": ["28,298,880"], "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.24, 0.61, 1.23, 1.34, 1.97, 2.34, 2.63, 3.16, 3.41, 3.66]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1].why"], "text": "A value rises this much almost only after a change of ownership, or new construction.", "t0": 85.89, "t1": 90.45, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "A value rises this much almost only after a change of ownership or new construction (or a corrected assessment); the roll does not say which."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.55, 0.99, 1.21, 1.47, 1.82, 2.12, 2.37, 2.43, 2.74, 2.88, 3.5, 3.7, 3.86]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1].why"], "text": "No sale date is on either roll. The roll doesn’t say which.", "t0": 90.57, "t1": 93.3, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "A value rises this much almost only after a change of ownership or new construction (or a corrected assessment); the roll does not say which."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.45, 0.69, 0.82, 0.98, 1.25, 1.5, 1.61, 1.82, 2.14, 2.34]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "suspicious[2].what"], "text": "9 sites the City rents carry an exemption:", "t0": 93.52, "t1": 96.36, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$353,304,129", "label": "exempt value on the 2026-27 roll", "sub": "9 rented sites"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.36, 0.71, 0.82, 1.09, 1.43, 1.73, 1.81]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "suspicious[2].what"], "text": "353,304,129 dollars of exempt value.", "t0": 96.36, "t1": 100.01, "shot": "b10c", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$353,304,129", "label": "exempt value on the 2026-27 roll", "sub": "9 rented sites"}, "emph": ["353,304,129"], "wt": [0.04, 0.34, 0.59, 0.94, 1.5, 1.76, 2.03, 2.35, 2.71, 2.8, 3.17]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what"], "text": "The largest: 845 Jackson Street,", "t0": 100.13, "t1": 103.08, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "845 Jackson Street", "kicker": "The largest", "sub": "welfare exemption, $232,196,298"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.93, 1.17, 1.73, 2.2]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what"], "text": "a welfare exemption of 232,196,298 dollars.", "t0": 103.08, "t1": 106.82, "shot": "b11x", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$232,196,298", "label": "welfare exemption", "sub": "845 Jackson Street"}, "emph": ["232,196,298"], "wt": [0.04, 0.2, 0.57, 1.03, 1.12, 1.35, 1.54, 1.84, 2.34, 2.6, 2.82, 3.17]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2].why"], "text": "An exemption applies when the property is used for the exempt purpose.", "t0": 106.94, "t1": 110.1, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "An exemption applies when the property is used for the exempt purpose."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.62, 1.08, 1.18, 1.26, 1.63, 1.79, 1.99, 2.11, 2.22, 2.59]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2].why"], "text": "City rent for its own offices is a use the claim must account for.", "t0": 110.22, "t1": 113.58, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "An exemption applies when the property is used for the exempt purpose."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.37, 0.59, 0.7, 0.87, 1.07, 1.56, 1.71, 1.83, 2.05, 2.15, 2.43, 2.65, 3.02]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "notEstablished[4]", "innocent[0]"], "text": "The rolls give no owner and no price.", "t0": 113.8, "t1": 115.77, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Who bought any building, or for how much", "That each sale date is a full sale"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.43, 0.64, 0.84, 1.14, 1.3, 1.47]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "notEstablished[4]", "innocent[0]"], "text": "A sale date can also mean a refinancing, or a transfer between related companies.", "t0": 115.89, "t1": 119.91, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Who bought any building, or for how much", "That each sale date is a full sale"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.42, 0.64, 0.8, 1.05, 1.2, 1.27, 2.03, 2.17, 2.23, 2.7, 3.0, 3.37]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["next[0]", "next[1]"], "text": "What would settle it? The deeds, and the Real Estate Division’s lease files.", "t0": 120.03, "t1": 124.01, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "", "what": "The deed and transfer-tax declaration for each sale"}, {"who": "", "what": "Whether each lease was assigned or renegotiated, and at what rent"}], "focus": 0}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.27, 0.58, 1.3, 1.48, 1.98, 2.16, 2.24, 2.43, 2.66, 3.13, 3.4]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "status", "ref": ["status", "defense[0]"], "text": "No authority has made a finding, and no landlord is accused.", "t0": 124.13, "t1": 127.18, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "status"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.64, 0.76, 0.9, 0.97, 1.47, 1.67, 1.85, 2.32, 2.45]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "end", "ref": ["end"], "text": "A lead is a question, not an accusation.", "t0": 127.3, "t1": 129.26, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.39, 0.49, 0.54, 0.98, 1.15, 1.23]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "3,559 days", "lead1": "Lead 1 · sold under it", "lead2": "Lead 2 · 1380 Howard", "lead3": "Lead 3 · exempt", "close": "Where it stands"}, "look": "map", "hook": "timeline"}